{%- comment -%}
  gs-media: the only way sections render content images (DESIGN.md §6.4).
  Draft reference: untested until the theme is pulled.

  Params
    image    image object (required)
    preset   where the image sits, which sets `sizes` and loading so the browser fetches the
             right width. Required unless `sizes` is passed (scripts/lint_theme.py checks):
               hero     photo or artwork hero, the page's main image: eager, fetchpriority high
               card     exhibition, programme and compact cards (1 / 2 / 3 columns)
               tile     artwork tiles and works in an exhibition (2 / 3 / 4 columns)
               gallery  installation views (1 / 2 / 3 columns)
               full     full-width image in a band or in text
    mode     'photo' (default) or 'artwork'. Chosen by the section type, never a staff setting.
    ratio    optional ratio override passed by a component, e.g. '3 / 2'. Never a staff setting.
    shape    'sm' | 'md' (default) | 'lg'
    sizes    explicit sizes attribute, only for a layout none of the presets fit
    loading  'lazy' (default, or 'eager' for the hero preset)
    class    extra wrapper classes

  Example
    {%- render 'gs-media', image: card_image, preset: 'card', mode: 'photo' -%}

  A blank image renders nothing, so no empty tinted box is left in the layout. In the theme
  editor a placeholder with a warning shows where the image is missing.

  photo    image_tag writes the editor's focal point as inline object-position, so cropping
           follows what staff chose in the image picker or Files.
  artwork  whole image on the mat; components.css pins object-position to the centre with
           !important, so a focal point set for another use of the same file can't shift it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign mode = mode | default: 'photo'
  assign shape = shape | default: 'md'
  assign fetchpriority = 'auto'
  case preset
    when 'hero'
      assign preset_sizes = '(min-width: 1536px) 1440px, 100vw'
      assign loading = loading | default: 'eager'
      assign fetchpriority = 'high'
    when 'card'
      assign preset_sizes = '(min-width: 1296px) 384px, (min-width: 990px) 31vw, (min-width: 750px) 47vw, 92vw'
    when 'tile'
      assign preset_sizes = '(min-width: 1296px) 276px, (min-width: 1200px) 22vw, (min-width: 750px) 30vw, 46vw'
    when 'gallery'
      assign preset_sizes = '(min-width: 1536px) 448px, (min-width: 1200px) 30vw, (min-width: 750px) 47vw, 92vw'
    when 'full'
      assign preset_sizes = '100vw'
  endcase
  assign sizes = sizes | default: preset_sizes | default: '100vw'
  assign loading = loading | default: 'lazy'
  assign alt = image.alt | default: ''
-%}
{%- if image != blank -%}
  <div class="gs-media gs-media--{{ mode }} gs-shape-{{ shape }}{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
    {%- if ratio != blank %} style="--gs-media-ratio: {{ ratio }}"{% endif %}>
    {{- image | image_url: width: 2400 | image_tag: loading: loading, fetchpriority: fetchpriority, sizes: sizes, widths: '400, 600, 800, 1200, 1600, 2000, 2400', alt: alt -}}
  </div>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="gs-media gs-media--{{ mode }} gs-shape-{{ shape }}{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">
    <span class="gs-editor-warning">Add an image. Visitors see nothing here until you do.</span>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
